      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "call-row",
      "description": "Schematic documentation preview; native SwiftUI remains authoritative. Browser pixels, typography, symbols, corners, focus and hover feedback are illustrative. Purpose/time then outcome/number; metadata stacks from xxxLarge. QuietSurface symbol slot disappears at accessibility sizes. One actionable spoken description includes purpose, state, shown number and complete date, without redundant full-date child labels. New message stays in words; Home hides number. Synthetic preview. Native control semantics: Design/CallNavigationRow.swift; visual layout: Design/CallRow.swift.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-call\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Appointment reminder. Answered. Monday, October 12, 2026 at 9:30 AM.\"><span class=\"ds-row-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 3h4l2 5-3 2a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l2-3 5 2v4c0 2-2 3-4 2C9 19 5 15 3 7 2 5 3 3 5 3z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-call-content\"><span class=\"ds-call-main\"><strong>Appointment reminder</strong><span>Yesterday</span></span><span class=\"ds-call-detail\">Answered</span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-call{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;min-height:60px;width:100%;max-width:360px;padding:10px 0;border:0;background:#FFFFFF;color:#101E32;font:1rem system-ui;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-call-main{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-call-main>span{color:rgb(32% 37% 44%);font-size:.9375rem}.ds-call-detail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:#076C5C;font-size:.9375rem}.ds-call-detail svg{width:18px;height:18px}.ds-call:hover{filter:brightness(.96)}.ds-call:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #002664;outline-offset:3px}.ds-call:active{filter:brightness(.9)}.ds-call:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-call-main>span{color:rgb(72% 77% 84%)}.ds-call-detail{color:#74DDC6}}.ds-call-content{display:grid;gap:6px;flex:1}.ds-call .ds-row-symbol{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;flex-shrink:0;background:#E7EBF1;color:#076C5C;border-radius:10px}.ds-call .ds-row-symbol svg{width:20px;height:20px}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-call{background:#1C293B;color:#F3F6FB}.ds-call .ds-row-symbol{background:#28364A;color:#74DDC6}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Message inbox row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "voicemail-row",
      "description": "Schematic documentation preview; native SwiftUI remains authoritative. Browser pixels, typography, symbols, corners, focus and hover feedback are illustrative. Purpose then kind/state/date, with no paragraph excerpt. Metadata stacks from xxxLarge; the leading symbol disappears at accessibility sizes. One actionable spoken description includes the complete date without redundant child labels. Full authorized summary remains in detail. Synthetic preview. Native control semantics: Features/Calls/MessageNavigationRow.swift; visual layout: Features/Calls/VoicemailRow.swift.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-voicemail\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Appointment reminder. Saved notice. New message. Tuesday, October 13, 2026 at 10:00 AM.\"><strong>Appointment reminder</strong><span class=\"ds-vm-meta\"><span>Saved notice</span><span class=\"ds-vm-new\">New</span><span>Today</span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-voicemail{display:grid;gap:8px;min-height:60px;width:100%;max-width:360px;padding:10px 0;border:0;background:#FFFFFF;color:#101E32;font:1rem system-ui;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-voicemail>span{color:rgb(32% 37% 44%)}.ds-voicemail .ds-vm-new{color:#7244B9;font-weight:500}.ds-vm-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;font-size:.9375rem}.ds-voicemail:hover{filter:brightness(.96)}.ds-voicemail:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #002664;outline-offset:3px}.ds-voicemail:active{filter:brightness(.9)}.ds-voicemail:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-voicemail>span{color:rgb(72% 77% 84%)}}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-voicemail{background:#1C293B;color:#F3F6FB}}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-voicemail .ds-vm-new{color:#CAAEFF}}"
    },
