      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-container",
      "description": "Schematic documentation preview; native SwiftUI remains authoritative. Browser pixels, typography, symbols, corners, focus and hover feedback are illustrative. Shared shieldCard helper uses Card, 20-point corner and padding; native List/Form groups retain platform corners and separators. Source: Design/ShieldComponents.swift.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><strong>Your next step</strong><span>Use a number you already know.</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:grid;gap:8px;max-width:360px;padding:20px;border-radius:20px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#101E32;font:1rem system-ui}.ds-card span{color:rgb(32% 37% 44%)}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-card span{color:rgb(72% 77% 84%)}}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-card{background:#1C293B;color:#F3F6FB}}"
